WEBVTT

00:02.342 --> 00:03.801
KATARA: Water...

00:04.719 --> 00:05.887
Earth...

00:06.638 --> 00:07.847
Fire...

00:08.890 --> 00:10.225
Air.

00:11.184 --> 00:14.979
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.188 --> 00:19.234
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.442 --> 00:23.404
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

00:23.696 --> 00:27.116
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:27.200 --> 00:30.787
100 years passed and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar...

00:31.079 --> 00:32.830
An Airbender named Aang.

00:33.039 --> 00:35.083
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.291 --> 00:37.710
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.794 --> 00:38.962
AANG: Oof!

00:39.045 --> 00:41.714
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:41.923 --> 00:44.259
( ♪ )

00:48.012 --> 00:50.515
( MAN READING )

00:51.099 --> 00:53.518
OZAI: You have redeemed yourself, my son.

00:54.602 --> 00:56.145
Welcome home.

00:56.312 --> 00:58.439
MAI: I know one thing I care about.

00:58.773 --> 01:00.650
I care about you.

01:02.485 --> 01:04.320
SOKKA: A solar eclipse is coming.

01:04.404 --> 01:06.781
The sun will be entirely
blocked out by the moon

01:06.864 --> 01:09.325
and the firebenders will be helpless.

01:09.409 --> 01:11.995
That's the day we need to invade
the Fire Nation.

01:12.078 --> 01:13.746
The day of black sun.

01:13.955 --> 01:16.624
I've always known that I would
have to face the Fire Lord.

01:16.708 --> 01:19.627
But now I know I need to do it alone.

01:19.711 --> 01:22.964
( ♪ )

01:31.681 --> 01:33.808
( APPA GROANS )

01:33.891 --> 01:34.976
( MOMO CHATTERS )

01:35.059 --> 01:38.313
This is it, the official rendezvous
point for the invasion force.

01:38.396 --> 01:40.607
TOPH: How did you pick this place?

01:40.690 --> 01:43.568
SOKKA: Before we split up, my dad and I
found this island on a map.

01:43.651 --> 01:45.737
It's uninhabited,
and the harbor surrounded by cliffs

01:45.820 --> 01:47.655
seemed like the perfect secluded place.

01:47.739 --> 01:49.240
KATARA: Nice choice, Sokka.

01:49.324 --> 01:51.034
And we're here four days
ahead of schedule.

01:51.117 --> 01:53.202
Wait, four days?

01:53.328 --> 01:56.247
The invasion's in four days? Ugh!

01:56.331 --> 01:57.915
( YAWNS )

01:57.999 --> 02:00.543
Whatever, that's, like,
four days from now.

02:00.627 --> 02:02.420
Let's just calm down and...

02:02.503 --> 02:04.505
( SNORING )

02:04.964 --> 02:06.674
Sokka's got the right idea, Aang.

02:06.758 --> 02:08.509
We're here, we're ready.

02:08.593 --> 02:12.055
The best thing we can do now
is get plenty of rest.

02:12.388 --> 02:14.223
( GROANS ) I guess.

02:34.035 --> 02:36.579
AANG: Your days of tyranny
are over, Fire Lord.

02:36.663 --> 02:39.248
I'm bringing you down.

02:39.332 --> 02:41.167
Really?

02:41.250 --> 02:43.544
How do you plan on doing that

02:43.628 --> 02:46.381
when you're not even wearing pants?

02:46.464 --> 02:47.715
( YELLS )

02:47.799 --> 02:49.634
Oh, no.

02:57.558 --> 03:00.395
( CACKLING )

03:05.525 --> 03:07.235
( GASPS )

03:07.318 --> 03:09.195
( GRUNTING )

03:09.278 --> 03:10.488
( SIGHS )

03:10.655 --> 03:11.823
( MOMO CHATTERS )

03:11.906 --> 03:13.741
It was just a dream, Momo.

03:13.825 --> 03:15.618
I still have my pants.

03:15.702 --> 03:17.161
( CHATTERING )

03:17.245 --> 03:19.497
Well, I better keep training.

03:27.004 --> 03:28.297
( CHATTERS )

03:35.596 --> 03:38.015
Fresh fruit, Prince Zuko?

03:38.266 --> 03:40.685
May I wash your feet, sir?

03:40.935 --> 03:42.562
Head massage?

03:43.229 --> 03:44.647
Hot towel?

03:55.491 --> 03:57.577
( CROWD CHEERING )

03:57.660 --> 04:01.956
( GIRLS LAUGHING )

04:02.290 --> 04:04.500
( LAUGHING )

04:04.584 --> 04:05.877
Oh...

04:06.210 --> 04:08.171
Prince Zuko, is something wrong?

04:08.254 --> 04:09.964
You didn't take the palanquin.

04:10.047 --> 04:12.425
I'm just going to Mai's house,
it's not far.

04:12.508 --> 04:15.428
It's not a prince's place
to walk anywhere, sir.

04:34.697 --> 04:37.450
( THUDDING )

04:51.506 --> 04:54.050
Hey, how long have you been up?

04:54.133 --> 04:55.635
A couple hours.

04:55.718 --> 04:58.971
I got a lot more skills to
refine if I'm gonna fight Ozai.

04:59.055 --> 05:02.391
KATARA: You know,
there is such a thing as over training.

05:02.892 --> 05:05.228
( GRUNTING )

05:12.235 --> 05:13.402
You don't get it, do you?

05:13.486 --> 05:17.698
My form is bad, I'm sloppy,
and I still don't know any firebending.

05:17.782 --> 05:19.408
Not even the basics.

05:21.285 --> 05:24.372
That's okay, Aang, the eclipse will
block all firebending anyway.

05:24.455 --> 05:25.873
You don't need to know any.

05:25.957 --> 05:27.542
Plus, it's a stupid element.

05:27.625 --> 05:30.294
Okay, well, I still have to
work on everything else.

05:30.378 --> 05:32.630
I better spend the whole day training.

05:51.607 --> 05:53.025
( YAWNS )

05:53.109 --> 05:54.151
AANG: Good night, Katara.

05:54.569 --> 05:55.903
Good night, Sokka.

05:55.987 --> 05:57.780
Good night, Toph.

05:58.030 --> 06:00.408
Good night, Appa, good night, Momo.

06:00.533 --> 06:01.909
Good night, Appa and Mo...

06:01.993 --> 06:03.327
Go to sleep, already.

06:15.381 --> 06:17.884
( SNAPS FINGERS )

06:22.305 --> 06:24.724
Your days of tyranny
are over, Fire Lord.

06:24.807 --> 06:26.809
I'm bringing you down.

06:26.893 --> 06:30.479
And this time I brought pants.

06:30.813 --> 06:32.607
So it seems.

06:32.690 --> 06:36.819
But are you prepared
for your mathematics test?

06:36.903 --> 06:38.738
Math test?

06:38.821 --> 06:41.574
Oh, no, I forgot all about the math test.

06:41.657 --> 06:43.075
( OZAI CACKLING )

06:43.159 --> 06:46.412
( AANG SCREAMS )

06:46.913 --> 06:48.372
( GASPING )

06:48.456 --> 06:50.166
I've got to be ready.

06:59.342 --> 07:01.469
Aang, it's the middle of the night.

07:01.719 --> 07:03.679
You need to go back to sleep.

07:03.763 --> 07:06.641
But I forgot my pants and my math test.

07:07.433 --> 07:10.478
( SIGHS )

07:11.395 --> 07:13.189
Aang, sleep.

07:13.481 --> 07:15.650
Please, for me.

07:25.701 --> 07:27.870
( SHEEP BAAS )

07:27.954 --> 07:30.498
Tell me, if you could have
anything you wanted right now

07:30.581 --> 07:32.041
what would it be?

07:32.124 --> 07:36.587
Hmm... A big fancy fruit tart
with rose petals on top.

07:36.671 --> 07:40.549
You know, being a prince and all,
I might just be able to make that happen.

07:40.967 --> 07:43.761
( LAUGHS ) That would be impressive.

07:44.428 --> 07:47.264
Do you think you can find
a fresh fruit tart for the lady?

07:47.348 --> 07:48.724
With rose petals on top?

07:48.808 --> 07:51.102
Excellent choice, sir.

07:51.185 --> 07:54.188
I guess there are some nice perks
that come with being royalty.

07:54.313 --> 07:56.524
Though there's annoying stuff too.

07:56.607 --> 07:58.985
Like that all-day war meeting coming up.

07:59.110 --> 08:01.445
War meeting, what are you talking about?

08:01.570 --> 08:02.822
Azula mentioned something.

08:03.114 --> 08:05.408
I, I assumed you were going too.

08:05.491 --> 08:08.327
I guess I wasn't invited.

08:11.998 --> 08:13.874
OZAI: Wake up, Aang.

08:14.083 --> 08:15.710
Wake up, sleepyhead.

08:17.294 --> 08:19.046
Rise and shine.

08:19.130 --> 08:20.923
You overslept.

08:21.007 --> 08:22.508
You missed the invasion.

08:22.883 --> 08:25.428
( CACKLING )

08:31.058 --> 08:33.686
Sokka, get up, I need to know
what day it is.

08:33.769 --> 08:35.563
What, who's talking?

08:35.646 --> 08:36.814
Ow.

08:38.107 --> 08:42.028
Relax, it's still two days
before the invasion.

08:42.528 --> 08:45.031
Sokka, you've got to get up
and drill your rock-climbing exercises.

08:45.156 --> 08:46.407
What?

08:46.866 --> 08:49.785
In one of my dreams, you were
running from Fire Nation soldiers

08:49.869 --> 08:51.287
trying to climb this cliff.

08:51.370 --> 08:53.122
But you were too slow and they got you.

08:53.456 --> 08:56.208
But that was just a dream,
I'm a great climber.

08:56.333 --> 08:59.295
Then climb that cliff, climb it fast.

09:07.178 --> 09:10.890
Stupid Avatar, stupid cliff, stupid dream.

09:10.973 --> 09:12.308
I can climb fast.

09:14.310 --> 09:16.437
- Don't drink that!
-( SOKKA SCREAMS )

09:16.520 --> 09:18.647
Why, is it poisoned?

09:18.898 --> 09:21.358
In my dream, we were right
in the middle of the invasion

09:21.525 --> 09:23.819
and you had to stop
to use the bathroom.

09:23.903 --> 09:25.946
We died because of your
tiny bladder.

09:26.030 --> 09:28.074
And you need to start
wearing your hair up.

09:28.157 --> 09:30.826
In my dream, your hair
got caught in a train and...

09:30.910 --> 09:32.745
Aang, I know you're just
trying to help.

09:32.828 --> 09:34.413
But you really need to get a grip.

09:34.872 --> 09:35.956
You're unraveling.

09:36.248 --> 09:38.334
( SIGHS )

09:38.626 --> 09:41.462
You're right, I'm losing my mind.

09:43.756 --> 09:45.216
( SCREAMS )

09:50.221 --> 09:52.264
It's like every time I think
about how stressed I am,

09:52.348 --> 09:54.058
I just end up more stressed.

09:54.350 --> 09:56.519
I'm like a big growing snowball of nerves.

09:56.602 --> 09:58.270
Of course you are.

09:58.354 --> 10:01.482
That's 'cause you gotta fight the
Fire Lord, the baddest man on the planet.

10:01.565 --> 10:03.776
And you better win,
or we're all done for.

10:03.859 --> 10:05.236
Sokka, you're not helping.

10:05.319 --> 10:06.779
What?

10:06.862 --> 10:09.073
It's true, that's the deal, he knows it.

10:10.699 --> 10:12.785
( WHIMPERING )

10:12.868 --> 10:14.912
You know what, I've got just the thing.

10:14.995 --> 10:17.873
Get ready to be de-stressified.

10:21.293 --> 10:24.797
These yoga stretches can really work
wonders if you do them in extreme heat.

10:25.506 --> 10:26.924
Reach up.

10:27.091 --> 10:29.093
Reach for the sun.

10:29.760 --> 10:32.638
Feel your chi paths clearing.

10:34.140 --> 10:36.100
Now close your eyes.

10:36.183 --> 10:37.768
How are you feeling?

10:37.977 --> 10:39.854
I feel...

10:40.062 --> 10:41.397
Really warm.

10:41.605 --> 10:43.440
KATARA: Good, good.

10:43.649 --> 10:45.192
Go on.

10:45.276 --> 10:47.945
Like there's this warm feeling
all around me.

10:48.028 --> 10:49.738
This heat.

10:50.447 --> 10:54.994
Like I'm in the Fire Lord's palace and
he's shooting a bunch of fireballs at me.

10:55.077 --> 10:58.038
And the whole world is being
engulfed in flames.

10:59.248 --> 11:02.126
Maybe your stress is the kind
you need to talk out.

11:02.209 --> 11:03.544
( PANTING )

11:06.172 --> 11:10.467
Why don't you get right down to business
and tell me what's been bothering you?

11:10.551 --> 11:12.136
You know what's bothering me.

11:12.219 --> 11:14.763
I have to fight
the Fire Lord in a few days.

11:14.847 --> 11:19.143
Mm-hmm... Tell me more about this...
Fire Lord.

11:19.226 --> 11:21.687
Why are you so afraid of him?

11:21.896 --> 11:25.107
You said it yourself,
he's the baddest man on the planet.

11:25.191 --> 11:27.651
I'm supposed to defeat him
and save the world.

11:27.860 --> 11:31.197
Mmm, life does feel that way
sometimes, doesn't it?

11:31.280 --> 11:34.992
Like we're all trying to
save the world from evil?

11:35.075 --> 11:37.077
Okay, but what can I do to feel better?

11:37.369 --> 11:40.456
Wanna try screaming into this pillow?

11:43.042 --> 11:46.045
( MUFFLED SCREAM )

11:46.587 --> 11:47.922
( BAAS )

11:58.390 --> 12:00.100
AZULA: Hello, Zu-zu.

12:00.184 --> 12:03.687
If you've come for a royal hair-combing,
I'm afraid you'll have to wait.

12:03.896 --> 12:06.106
So I guess there's a big
war meeting coming up, huh?

12:06.232 --> 12:07.942
And apparently I'm not welcome there.

12:08.234 --> 12:10.694
What do you mean,
of course you're welcome there.

12:10.778 --> 12:11.820
Oh, yeah?

12:11.904 --> 12:14.365
I guess that's why no one
bothered to tell me about it.

12:14.531 --> 12:17.076
Oh, Zuko, don't be so dramatic.

12:17.159 --> 12:19.119
I'm certain dad wants you there.

12:19.203 --> 12:20.996
You probably just weren't invited

12:21.080 --> 12:23.540
because it's so obvious that
you're supposed to be there.

12:23.624 --> 12:25.334
Well, were you invited?

12:25.417 --> 12:27.795
Of course, I'm the princess.

12:28.003 --> 12:29.588
And I'm the prince.

12:29.797 --> 12:33.175
Exactly, so stop acting like
a paranoid child.

12:33.300 --> 12:34.677
Just go to the meeting.

12:34.885 --> 12:36.804
Forget it, I'm not going.

12:40.349 --> 12:43.727
TOPH: All right, what you need is a good
old-fashioned back-pounding

12:43.811 --> 12:45.646
to relieve your stress.

12:45.729 --> 12:47.106
Pound away.

12:50.818 --> 12:52.820
Aah, ow...

12:53.028 --> 12:57.616
Toph, I think this is bruising me.

12:57.700 --> 13:00.661
( GRUNTING )

13:00.869 --> 13:04.039
Sorry, I forgot you have baby skin.

13:04.373 --> 13:07.126
Well, there's one other thing we can try.

13:09.169 --> 13:10.963
Acupuncture.

13:11.672 --> 13:14.341
( SCREAMS )

13:17.428 --> 13:20.014
MAI: Zuko, it's just a dumb meeting.

13:20.097 --> 13:21.515
Who cares?

13:21.598 --> 13:22.850
I don't.

13:23.058 --> 13:25.102
Well, good, you shouldn't.

13:25.227 --> 13:27.313
I mean, why would you even want to go?

13:27.604 --> 13:30.691
Just think about how things went
at the last war meeting you went to.

13:30.774 --> 13:32.985
ZUKO: ( SIGHS ) I know.

13:33.193 --> 13:36.196
You know what will make you feel better?

13:36.405 --> 13:38.407
Ordering some servants around.

13:38.741 --> 13:41.660
I might be hungry for
a whole tray of fruit tarts.

13:42.161 --> 13:45.998
And maybe a little palanquin
ride around town, double-time.

13:55.132 --> 13:57.259
Thanks for everything, guys.

13:57.343 --> 14:00.763
So do you feel less stressed,
ready for a good night's sleep?

14:00.846 --> 14:05.851
Uh, I kind of think I sort of
might slightly feel a little better.

14:06.060 --> 14:07.436
Maybe.

14:07.519 --> 14:10.230
Then our work here is done. ( YAWNS )

14:10.314 --> 14:12.608
( KATARA AND TOPH YAWN )

14:18.447 --> 14:22.159
( THUNDER CRASHING )

14:22.368 --> 14:24.745
( CHATTERING )

14:32.419 --> 14:34.254
( DISTORTED VOICE )

14:42.721 --> 14:45.099
( SCREAMING )

14:48.102 --> 14:49.895
( GRUNTS )

14:53.023 --> 14:56.151
( OZAI CACKLING )

14:56.485 --> 14:58.278
( SCREAMS )

15:15.045 --> 15:16.713
Shh...

15:22.761 --> 15:24.596
( SCREAMS )

15:25.222 --> 15:27.224
( ROARS )

15:27.808 --> 15:29.393
What happened, Aang?

15:29.601 --> 15:30.936
It's the nightmares.

15:31.019 --> 15:33.063
They just get worse and worse.

15:33.147 --> 15:36.024
Looks like it's time
for another therapy session.

15:36.733 --> 15:38.735
No, that won't help.

15:38.819 --> 15:40.195
Nothing helps.

15:40.279 --> 15:42.364
There's only one thing I can do.

15:42.531 --> 15:45.117
I'm gonna stay awake straight
through to the invasion.

15:55.586 --> 15:57.087
Invasion...

15:57.171 --> 15:59.715
All aboard for the invasion.

15:59.798 --> 16:01.717
You don't look so good.

16:01.925 --> 16:04.595
You sure you can't just lie down
for a little nap?

16:04.887 --> 16:07.598
I told you, I can't go back to sleep.

16:07.806 --> 16:10.309
Aang, staying up all night
can't be good for you.

16:10.517 --> 16:13.979
Actually, staying up all night
has given me some time to think.

16:14.188 --> 16:16.356
And I've realized some big things, Katara.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.941
What big things?

16:18.233 --> 16:20.194
I see everything so clearly now.

16:20.277 --> 16:23.405
What really matters,
why I'm really doing this.

16:23.614 --> 16:26.283
I'm doing it to save the world,
but more than that...

16:26.492 --> 16:28.410
I'm doing it for the people I love.

16:28.619 --> 16:30.829
I'm doing it for you, Katara.

16:31.038 --> 16:33.123
Aang, what are you saying?

16:33.332 --> 16:36.001
I'm saying... I love you.

16:45.552 --> 16:47.137
What are we doing?

16:47.221 --> 16:50.891
What our hearts have been telling us
to do for a long, long time.

16:51.099 --> 16:53.685
Baby, you're my forever girl.

16:54.311 --> 16:55.646
KATARA: Aang...

16:55.729 --> 16:56.897
Uh?

16:57.147 --> 17:00.150
I was just saying
you should take a nap.

17:00.609 --> 17:03.904
Oh, I guess
kind of drifted off into a daydream.

17:04.488 --> 17:06.240
What was your dream about?

17:07.574 --> 17:09.618
Uh, living underwater.

17:10.285 --> 17:11.620
Sounds neat.

17:11.787 --> 17:13.413
( CHUCKLES )

17:14.081 --> 17:15.207
Whew.

17:19.586 --> 17:22.339
Prince Zuko, everyone's
waiting for you.

17:22.506 --> 17:23.840
What?

17:24.007 --> 17:25.342
The high admirals, high generals,

17:25.425 --> 17:27.344
the war ministers,
and the princess have all arrived.

17:27.469 --> 17:29.012
You're the only person missing.

17:29.346 --> 17:32.474
So... My dad wants me at the meeting?

17:32.683 --> 17:35.227
The Fire Lord said he would not
start until you arrived, sir.

17:43.402 --> 17:44.444
( EXHALES )

17:44.528 --> 17:47.322
Put 'em up, Fire Lord.

17:50.909 --> 17:52.911
( YELLS )

17:53.036 --> 17:55.122
Hey, I'm trying to build
Appa some armor here

17:55.205 --> 17:57.332
so he doesn't have to go
into the invasion naked.

17:57.499 --> 17:58.875
He's your bison.

17:59.084 --> 18:00.669
Ozai's defense is impeccable.

18:00.752 --> 18:03.463
I'll have to try a different approach.

18:03.797 --> 18:05.632
( YELLS )

18:12.973 --> 18:15.934
You think you're untouchable,
don't you, Mr. Fire Lord?

18:16.018 --> 18:19.021
VOICE: Boy, you are really
starting to lose it, kid.

18:20.063 --> 18:22.983
Momo, did you hear something?

18:23.859 --> 18:26.403
VOICE: No, but I said something.

18:26.612 --> 18:28.113
Uh...

18:28.280 --> 18:31.408
You, my friend, are just a few
plums short of a fruit pie.

18:36.496 --> 18:39.207
( CHATTERING )

18:40.626 --> 18:42.252
That's more like it.

18:42.461 --> 18:45.756
I'm so tired that for a second there,
I imagined you were talking to me.

18:45.964 --> 18:47.215
( CHATTERS )

18:47.424 --> 18:49.968
Oh, Momo, let me explain.

18:50.052 --> 18:53.096
( CHATTERING )

18:53.430 --> 18:55.807
( MOMO CHATTERING )

18:56.016 --> 18:59.978
( LAUGHING, CHATTERING )

19:00.062 --> 19:01.438
KATARA: Aang?

19:01.688 --> 19:04.399
We're all starting to get
a little worried about you.

19:05.108 --> 19:06.902
You've been awake too long.

19:07.110 --> 19:09.863
And you're acting downright weird.

19:10.197 --> 19:12.574
You've got to take care of yourself.

19:12.658 --> 19:15.118
You can't go on like this.

19:15.410 --> 19:18.830
( GROANS ) Look, I appreciate
what you guys are saying

19:18.914 --> 19:21.041
but the stress and the nightmares...

19:21.333 --> 19:23.085
They were just too much.

19:23.293 --> 19:25.587
Staying awake is the best way
for me to deal with it.

19:25.796 --> 19:27.881
Yeah, leave the kid alone.

19:28.090 --> 19:30.050
Hey, who asked you?

19:30.258 --> 19:32.344
AANG: Guys, come on.

19:32.511 --> 19:34.763
No, I am sick of this guy

19:34.846 --> 19:37.182
always mouthing off
and telling me what to do.

19:37.265 --> 19:38.809
Oh, you don't like it?

19:38.892 --> 19:40.310
Well, let's go right now.

19:40.519 --> 19:42.688
Sokka, what should we do?

19:42.771 --> 19:43.855
About what?

19:43.980 --> 19:45.399
About that.

19:54.700 --> 19:57.703
( ROARING )

19:57.786 --> 19:59.621
( SCREECHING )

19:59.830 --> 20:01.039
( SWORDS CLANG )

20:05.877 --> 20:08.255
Appa, Appa, Appa.

20:08.338 --> 20:10.882
Momo, Momo, Momo.

20:19.933 --> 20:23.603
Come on, guys, we're all
on the same side.

20:23.687 --> 20:27.941
♪ Chakras, chakras,
everybody loves chakras ♪

20:28.024 --> 20:30.694
♪ Chakras, chakras ♪

20:30.777 --> 20:33.405
♪ Chakra sandwich
tastes good, yum... ♪

20:38.702 --> 20:41.288
Yay, yay, yay, yay, yay!

20:43.790 --> 20:46.334
( WHIMPERS )

20:51.256 --> 20:52.716
( CHEERING )

21:01.391 --> 21:03.560
I just need to jump in
a cold waterfall.

21:03.769 --> 21:06.563
( SCREAMING )

21:13.528 --> 21:15.655
So how did it go?

21:15.739 --> 21:18.992
When I got to the meeting,
everyone welcomed me.

21:19.451 --> 21:21.286
My father had saved me a seat.

21:21.369 --> 21:23.038
He wanted me next to him.

21:23.121 --> 21:25.540
I was literally at his right hand.

21:25.624 --> 21:27.501
Zuko, that's wonderful.

21:27.584 --> 21:30.045
You must be happy.

21:35.008 --> 21:38.220
During the meeting,
I was the perfect prince.

21:39.095 --> 21:41.556
The son my father wanted.

21:41.765 --> 21:44.226
But I wasn't me.

22:00.659 --> 22:03.203
Oh, look, another hallucination.

22:03.286 --> 22:05.539
An imaginary bed made out of clouds.

22:05.622 --> 22:07.123
TOPH: Hey, it's real.

22:07.332 --> 22:09.042
We spent hours working on it.

22:09.125 --> 22:10.252
We made it for you.

22:10.418 --> 22:12.629
A good night's sleep will
probably take the crazy away.

22:12.712 --> 22:13.922
We hope.

22:14.047 --> 22:17.175
Look, you guys keep telling me
I need to sleep, but I can't.

22:17.259 --> 22:19.135
The invasion's tomorrow.

22:19.302 --> 22:20.387
Aang...

22:20.470 --> 22:23.014
No, Katara, there's still
so much I haven't learned.

22:23.181 --> 22:26.226
I don't need sleep,
what I need is practice.

22:26.309 --> 22:28.436
Quick, hit me.

22:28.645 --> 22:30.105
I'm not going to hit you.

22:30.313 --> 22:31.606
You want me to do it?

22:31.815 --> 22:33.483
Listen to me.

22:33.567 --> 22:35.777
You've been training for this
since the day we met.

22:35.986 --> 22:37.696
I've seen your progress.

22:37.904 --> 22:39.906
You're smart, brave, and strong enough.

22:40.115 --> 22:41.950
You really think so?

22:42.158 --> 22:43.577
We all do.

22:43.660 --> 22:45.912
You can do this, you're ready.

22:45.996 --> 22:48.498
You're the man, twinkle toes.

22:48.790 --> 22:50.625
Thanks, guys.

22:52.794 --> 22:54.504
( YAWNS )

22:58.258 --> 23:00.093
( YAWNS )

23:00.302 --> 23:01.970
You know what?

23:02.178 --> 23:04.598
I think I am ready.

23:12.772 --> 23:15.275
Your days of tyranny are over, Fire Lord.

23:15.483 --> 23:18.236
Really, you're going to take me out?

23:18.445 --> 23:20.655
You're not even wearing pants.

23:21.239 --> 23:24.492
No, Fire Lord Ozai,
you're not wearing pants.

23:25.201 --> 23:27.746
( GASPS, SCREAMS )

23:27.996 --> 23:29.539
No!

23:29.623 --> 23:32.584
My royal parts are showing.

23:32.792 --> 23:35.211
( OZAI SCREAMS )

23:47.557 --> 23:51.061
( ♪ )
